  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#concept-media-load-algorithm defines a synchronous section that must run in a stable state, which is fine. However, the object and children modes define that the synchronous section section ends and remaining steps should run in parallel, which includes the [resource fetch algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#concept-media-load-resource). This algorithm can modify state and dispatch events, so it's not totally clear what running in parallel is supposed to mean.\n",
